            <ArticleTitle>Chocolate: a review of published reports of allergic and other deleterious effects, real or presumed.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>195-207</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Although there are specific contraindications to the ingestion of chocolate by selected individuals, these do not apply to the general population with a frequency that is suggested by the pervasive mistrust of chocolate. These contraindications and mistrusts are reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
